Comment:
 ABMod is a set of modifications to OpenWebRX, which is the work of
 Jakob Ketterl, DD5JFK, and its contributors - https://www.openwebrx.de and
 https://github.com/jketterl/openwebrx. The files this package installs are
 derived from that work and carry its licence.
 .
 Also used: Leaflet for the map; map tiles from the OpenStreetMap
 contributors; position data from aprs.fi; the APRS symbols of the
 aprs-symbols project; NASA SRTM elevation data, distributed as public tiles.
 No repeater data is included in this package.

